# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as long as the script is
#  commit the template would be regenerated (and potentially updated).
#  Instead, PyInstaller itself can use this ignorelist
*.manifest
*.spec

